<title>USA: Dean Witter shareholders approve merger.</title>
<headline>Dean Witter shareholders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>JERSEY CITY, N.J. 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co shareholders approved a proposed merger with Morgan Stanley Group Inc at a shareholder meeting on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The stock-swap merger was originally announced in February and was valued at $10.5 billion at the time of the announcement.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley shareholders are voting on the deal later this morning.</p>
